ira my mom took me secure when I was really young and the shapes and the color palettes and the general mood of the film had always been a big inspiration for easy and going to auto shows of my dad you know the first time I saw a white Lamborghini Countach in real life and I remember the guy said I couldn't even touch the car and I was obsessed with this car as a child you know is there any shoe that that Countach is you know kind of represented in there's a little bit of Lamborghini and everything I do okay so Suzy is the Lamborghini of shoes you the idea comes to you you sketch it out and then what we have a team of incredible designers will take the entire design team to Japan will take the entire design team to zone and talk about you know where we would like to take these ideas and I mean it's a painting it's just it's just it's a spirit the that's in inside of it that's now translated into these miniature vehicles I'm just soaking in all the shoes I like look at all these look at these designs look at these ideas all together the proto's the the versions that you've seen in actuality and the versions that never quite made it to be able to see inside this is you know this is an infinite amount of words in front of you there's so many prototypes that go into what you eventually get how many prototypes you think per shoe build cycle through before you get to its hundreds we work on we like I said miniature vehicles we work on shoes like someone will work on a car let's say we're looking at 2,000 shoes how many do you think are prototypes that will never be available outside of the circle I'm not a numbers guy okay but mostly I'm a feeling it's a it's an inspiration channeling you know and I'm not this isn't this isn't I'm not a numbers guy that's the thing yeah that's this yes the thing is everyone you it's it's all these like calculations this something this right here is you say you love sneakers right yeah you can't calculate love you love seeing these I love seeing them I'm just curious what's the feeling that you get joy so when you get joy do you try to calculate you know like if if you get a surprise cake from your grandmother and you didn't know she was in town yeah do you start asking her about the batter and specifically the frostings perhaps not that I'm not writing a story about my grandma so well that's what people need to realize about artists and people who dedicate their life and go to the hospital and back to bring joy that they should be loved and treat it like how you a treat your grandmother giving you a cake because these things are made to bring uncalculated asked me to somehow translate this to numbers is to ask your grandmother exactly what the recipe of the cake was their spirit their spirit inside of this thing it's a soul it's like that wasn't calculated when Jordan switched hands the fact that people are seeing all of these all of these shoes are inside of every single ship it all flows through everything flows into everything and this is how connected we are as as human beings all of them have a spirit they're all of the family there's not one bad shoe any of these shoes that even didn't make it 20 years from now you'll look up and that she would be you know worse to the numbers guys you know you know what's that what you know what's a Picasso sketch work a Warhol sketch look from this put yourself in the center just walk right here you can step on some of these come to the middle don't worry about stepping on them I know the maker how do you feel still patient and blessed or any of them talking to you right now yeah there are a lot that I really love I mean I love them all you","uploadedAt":"2026-07-28T04:19:10.108Z","chunks":[{"id":"doc_1785212350108_2ioqep_c0","text":"I'll be working on home designs and looking at references from 3,000 years ago and reading the Old Testament at the same time so it's like soundtrack to the visuals of the shapes and the idea ideas and ideals of what we're creat