5313606917,"raphael":0.06062317090802484,"child":0.04531389378955194}},{"id":"doc_1785212350168_21tbmo_c4","text":"embraced the spontaneity and playfulness of a child's Vision showing a sense of joy and creative Liberation Picasso's later works embraced the spontaneity and playfulness of a child's Vision showing a sense of joy and creative Liberation though Picasso is best known for his paintings he was also a prolific sculptor in his later years he became fascinated with sculpture often using unconventional materials like metal wood and junk to create bold abstract forms these sculptures pushed the boundaries of traditional art much like his paintings had done but as Picasso Grew Older he also became more reflective he began to look back on his life and Legacy acknowledging the many phases he had passed through and the impact he had made on the art world he knew that he had changed art forever but he was still driven by a desire to explore he never stopped experimenting and innovating until the very end on April 8th 1973 at the age of 91 Pablo Picasso passed away in muan France his death marked the end of an era but his legacy had only just begun Picasso had created over 50,000 Works in his lifetime paintings drawings prints sculptures and Ceramics his Relentless creativity his fearlessness and his unwavering desire to push the boundaries of art have ensured that his work will live on forever today Pablo p oo is celebrated as one of the most influential artists of the 20th century if not all of art history his work has shaped the way we think about art and his impact can still be seen in modern artists around the world even after his death Picasso's work continues to break records at auctions his paintings regularly sell for hundreds of millions of dollars making him one of the most valuable artists in history his influence on the Art Market is unparalleled and and his name is eternally associated with greatness Picasso's life was one of endless Innovation boundless creativity and a deep passion for expression he transformed the art world not once but multiple times and his work continues to inspire generations of artists today as we look back on Picasso's life we are reminded that art is not about following the rules it's about breaking them it's about seeing the world in a new way and sharing that Vision with others Picasso's Legacy is a testament to the power of art to change not just how we see the world but how we experience it the legacy of Pablo Picasso is more than just paintings and sculptures it's a revolution in the way we understand art itself he dared to challenge the Norms of his time to dismantle reality and to reassemble it in a way that forced the world to look at itself differently from the cubis movement to the surrealist experiment from his depictions of love to the horrors of War Picasso's work covers the entire spectrum of human emotion and experience he taught us that art is","t0":800,"t1":1000,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"50":0.042153992624937665,"91":0.050328217661331866,"1973":0.05372082757897942,"embraced":0.10744165515795884,"spontaneity":0.11700488539545215,"playfulness":0.11700488539545215,"child":0.08745743368838502,"vision":0.1366398076277557,"showing":0.0953934099363698,"sense":0.06795953517708694,"joy":0.09109320508517046,"creative":0.06269650979079303,"liberation":0.11700488539545215,"picasso":0.2722362948608286,"later":0.06652965328368154,"works":0.05839630493959366,"though":0.03195315230094195,"best":0.02919815246979683,"known":0.03134825489539651,"his":0.4015998134327092,"paintings":0.15976576150470975,"he":0.20694958141616046,"prolific":0.04554660254258523,"sculptor":0.05372082757897942,"years":0.024093423606868083,"became":0.07285688148884771,"fascinated":0.05372082757897942,"sculpture":0.04372871684419251,"often":0.036428440744423855,"unconventional":0.05850244269772607,"materials":0.0476967049681849,"like":0.02941721393558599,"metal":0.05372082757897942,"wood":0.05372082757897942,"j