desirable than the result itself. So, I hope you start to hear a theme here, and I'm going to build my argument. And then we think about things like a crash diet. Anybody here been on a crash diet? New Year's resolution to lose a lot of weight. The problem with crash diets there, the the hint is in the title itself, crash. Maybe the word die. So, you're on this yo-yo diet, right? When you may start off large and get to medium small, but because this is not a lifelong pursuit because you see it as a very short-term goal to hit, maybe once you hit the goal, you regress because those habits haven't been formed inside of you. Kind of an important thing to think about. Okay? And then, I'm this is not a real term. Does anybody here want fast fans? Okay. Okay. I didn't think so. You don't have to agree with me. We can have an argument. This can be very interactive. So, people of convenience maybe. So, what's the problem with fast fans? Well, I don't know about you. This is a generated image, but it's a symbol for the things that are going on with engagement farms. You pay, you get the views. As soon as you stop paying, you don't get the views. You don't get the fake engagement. And I would rather have a hundred people who are dedicated who truly want to consume my content than","t0":200,"t1":400,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"person":0.028798230214617762,"want":0.06760910155728374,"ask":0.04080836547268963,"question":0.03987450912790299,"okay":0.09766237836691834,"reflect":0.05776519914882408,"idea":0.07481337377735822,"little":0.02802455974298835,"bit":0.03598057453943934,"era":0.14514921600939998,"fast":0.33868150402193326,"fashion":0.16724583003856722,"consequence":0.17329559744647227,"know":0.07609496345321955,"certain":0.048383072003133326,"brands":0.10948965766164168,"make":0.02357807707574535,"things":0.16891437608167292,"really":0.0683681263652726,"quickly":0.048383072003133326,"only":0.03242933036395105,"destroy":0.052277006591596974,"legitimate":0.067147326294514