 more than they want to take care of us. Yes. Last one is you have to be logical. You have to be able to explain ideas in ways that are easy to follow. So I think the pursuit for you is to become a better educator to teach people. And my saying is this. If you want to reach more people, teach more people. Okay. Uh this is a quote from Alex Ramosi. You cannot wish for both strong character and an easy life. The price of each is the other. You want an easy life or you want to be have to have strong character. Okay, this is my full circle moment. Okay, it looks like I'm I'm like antiviral and like I don't want to be successful at all. I started a company, a YouTube channel called The Future in 2014. So, some quick stats for you. We've made over 2,000 videos, a gazillion hours, over a million dollars in revenue, and we've had 24 videos that have had million plus views. So, there's nothing wrong with going viral. Okay, that","t0":3000,"t1":3200,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"24":0.06715275977524376,"300":0.06077266792363876,"2014":0.07805959883542193,"car":0.15370492197429436,"gt":0.05014876392832268,"make":0.05481961350987365,"haircuts":0.0716795069838169,"yes":0.08212027732827126,"here":0.06429553689036335,"told":0.046354610943574376,"her":0.08697147402371118,"ever":0.04348573701185559,"thought":0.044385138521624075,"driving":0.06077266792363876,"uh":0.09159744127408728,"like":0.15700513091614077,"van":0.06364154185535753,"coloring":0.0716795069838169,"she":0.07925735132428305,"goes":0.039628675662141524,"yeah":0.07925735132428305,"know":0.06634600342649423,"long":0.039628675662141524,"drive":0.05123497399143145,"think":0.07441619072320435,"need":0.1377289703788371,"go":0.06106496084939151,"ethnic":0.07805959883542193,"communities":0.0716795069838169,"talk":0.03831664581511499,"sudden":0.0716795069838169,"speak":0.05439257607203375,"arabic":0.07805959883542193,"farsy":0.07805959883542193,"whatever":0.04263497616716809,"re":0.022571460401267753,"wow":0.06077266792363876