f about what you can and can't pull off in this life. And the next thing he would do is say, \"Oh, what is that uh did you take that belt buckle off the airplane? Like do does TSA know about this?\" Trying to give me a hard time. I'm like, \"I'm good with it. You You You want to play? We can We can dance, right?\" And and and we have these conversations about what makes you comfortable uncomfortable. And now, this is great cuz Trevor if you're ever watching this his game has changed. He's dressing differently and he's like sending me DMs like, \"Hey, is this a good fit or not?\" And so, I I like that for each person. It doesn't have to be about fashion. It could be, \"Oh, you never thought you could drive that kind of car.\" Or you never thought you could live in that house or that neighborhood or date that","t0":800,"t1":1000,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"don":0.09273089242972235,"enough":0.04027535767671573,"episodes":0.07373941645635461,"just":0.036718580580129306,"yet":0.04710602124995091,"there":0.05784852224866319,"like":0.22247360171846314,"oh":0.18717719933620913,"chain":0.0677124286535194,"he":0.28091500157467575,"tell":0.03206919999430613,"poor":0.1722276748552055,"cuz":0.06902292625880843,"dressed":0.060119322015618516,"people":0.12925480533396544,"look":0.09487636253843561,"promise":0.060119322015618516,"let":0.05768534102331236,"bring":0.05138223714889997,"show":0.035052045644280536,"line":0.04981611831383427,"here":0.1518428047855912,"sit":0.06343621275457036,"talk":0.07239204774619641,"um":0.04027535767671573,"know":0.04178273737733627,"net":0.07373941645635461,"worth":0.0531330090527861,"accomplishments":0.07373941645635461,"take":0.06599705278718986,"down":0.03878767902835327,"dimension":0.06343621275457036,"want":0.049497683884992566,"chances":0.06343621275457036,"probably":0.03878767902835327,"me":0.11716275257839268,"beat":0.05740922495173516,"couple":0.04981611831383427,"categories":0.0677124286535194,"kind":0.07010409128856107,"project":0.0551