ss theirs. Now, if you were to learn about storytelling and you're teaching storytelling, one way is mechanically say, \"Here's how you tell a story.\" The other more interesting way is you tell an amazing story and say, \"Do you want to know why I did that? Here's what happened.\" That becomes part of your brand. &gt;&gt; But then don't you just become the storytelling brand guy? &gt;&gt; Yeah, that's what you said you wanted to learn how to do. Storytelling. &gt;&gt; Well, I wanted to figure out a way out that I'm I just don't become that person cuz like why So what's the difference between me being the video guy or me being the storytelling guy? &gt;&gt; Okay, what is video guy? &gt;&gt; I'm the guy that you come to when you need like videos done. &gt;&gt; And what is it that's the underlying layer that you're selling? &gt;&gt; Views, reach for my clients. &gt;&gt; Is that what you're selling? &gt;&gt; Yes. Are you sure? &gt;&gt; I thought you're just selling video production at that point. If I'm a strategist to help people get views, conversions, audience building, all that kind of stuff, I don't talk about video production at all. I talk about video strategy. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; That's very different. &gt;&gt; Okay, but say I talk about video strategy. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; I thought when you said about being building your personal brand isn't about talking about what is it that you do? &gt;&gt; That's correct. &gt;&gt; So then wouldn't I just be the video strategy guy? &gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; So how do I move &gt;&gt; done anything to tell about your personal brand yet. &gt;&gt; So how do I get started with that? &gt;&gt; There's a couple things you need to do. Um I I've developed another workbook because I realized Unblend Yourself is dense book, it's 100-plus pages. It's deep inner work and people like their heads are melting right now. So I was thinking, \"How do I provide a quick win?\" I'll share a story. You and I were in Japan uh uh with uh 18 of our friends, some strangers and some some old friends. Uh I'm I'm I'm having a really good conversation with my buddy Chris Sergio. He goes, \"Chris, I love what you're doing. Can I give you some advice? I'm like, sure, please. And he's a brilliant guy, so of course I'm going to take advice from him.","t0":2000,"t1":2200,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"18":0.043534650087061304,"100":0.037825984607254726,"much":0.023684334327207835,"work":0.03115043881397966,"need":0.06696652400097289,"like":0.07633897094308914,"done":0.09453341453680465,"basics":0.05060547522708475,"now":0.048766623230941775,"structure":0.046469307671014606,"right":0.0343503528338564,"ve":0.044644349333981925,"learned":0.037825984607254726,"things":0.03637201422184166,"say":0.08684743949443995,"learn":0.1502568006217915,"don":0.06363883937724565,"mean":0.05051366450188855,"read":0.03418752768042844,"internalize":0.05060547522708475,"share":0.06302227635786978,"ideas":0.025690984765766627,"happens":0.030755159467231275,"inevitably":0.046469307671014606,"once":0.026144439167832143,"something":0.015741093701792816,"gets":0.035262314974921036,"mutated":0.05060547522708475,"own":0.021120664694874138,"brain":0.035262314974921036,"good":0.04401654322352402,"way":0.06947795159555196,"little":0.021120664694874138,"differently":0.03939848253099117,"embellish":0.05060547522708475,"remove":0.04125835282045188,"sudden":0.046469307671014606,"starts":0.04125835282045188,"become":0.07985697573348344,"yours":0.046469307671014606,"less":0.029392999807014413,"theirs":0.05060547522708475,"were":0.040091754800763095,"storytelling":0.23234653835507302,"re":0.07316457535118367,"teaching":0.035262314974921036,"mechanically":0.05060547522708475,"here":0.04168233308727853,"tell":0.06602481483528602,"story":0.07577049675283283,"interesting":0.03646382494703785,"amazing":0.03646382494703785,"want":0.016984497138804008,"know":0.014337211920574971,"why":0.03861626224627488,"happened":0.03418752768042844,"becomes":0.0412583528204