nut like myself and you look at fashion fashion week in in New York or or Paris, you can see all the shows going. And if you look at all of them like from Dior to Saint Laurent, and you look at them, the ones have the most views LV. Because he brings superstars to the show and he's thinking about it more as like pop culture theater and not just pure fashion. The most recent runway for the winter season, he built a Japanese home and put artificial turf and did this super beautiful lighting. I was like, that is very different. That is different than somebody say, let's just do our runway here in the middle of a factory. And like, I get that. There's an aesthetic to it. But this is theater. And he's spending a lot of money building these things to make us want it, to make it part of the conversation. Let's take another quite polarizing character. Jaden Smith, Will Smith's son. That Will Smith. Yeah. Jaden has become the first creative director for menswear for Christian Louboutin. Okay? Louboutin, as far as I know, doesn't even make fashion. He makes really amazing shoes. Why do you put this young nepo kid in charge of this brand? Well, we're all talking about Christian Louboutin for a minute, and it's all over the place. And he's a polarizing character who knows how to get attention. &gt;&gt; Right. &gt;&gt; Right? And you don't think Christian Louboutin knows what they're doing? Like, you'd be a fool. And I actually, for the first time, want to buy something from Christian Louboutin because of what Jaden's done. I'm not saying all of it's good. It's not, but it's not all meant to be good. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; Now, what they understand is this thing called the halo effect. Which is kind of like what it sounds like. We are going to direct your attention to something, then you check out the rest of the things, and the likelihood of you buying the rest of the thing is great. So, they can make five fuzzy boots and not worry that anybody's going to buy it. But because it's being talked about.","t0":2600,"t1":2800,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"brand":0.08153284877083837,"ve":0.02814912428310557,"yet":0.040766424385419185,"purchase":0.0548988749619615,"single":0.03706570784272421,"thing":0.06646016260143477,"pharrell":0.17579877451396939,"done":0.07947352425412416,"except":0.058599591504656455,"gt":0.3279818407597731,"prior":0.058599591504656455,"him":0.02855753670887983,"there":0.033375455981802256,"gentleman":0.06381545852158015,"named":0.043111792644090846,"virgil":0.06381545852158015,"abloh":0.06381545852158015,"passed":0.043111792644090846,"away":0.032397323912904466,"desperately":0.06381545852158015,"going":0.08663424290094889,"through":0.02941544860710446,"back":0.02736925455073526,"catalogs":0.06381545852158015,"grail":0.06381545852158015,"find":0.03706570784272421,"pieces":0.04770002733716547,"he":0.15628439058311738,"designed":0.04770002733716547,"because":0.10031379253964948,"exceptional":0.058599591504656455,"designer":0.05202837620370948,"okay":0.04640817289177793,"looking":0.0329691474252139,"books":0.08893428185622831,"don":0.0601882755237897,"disclose":0.06381545852158015,"imagine":0.05202837620370948,"very":0.07044222105985751,"small":0.040766424385419185,"percentage":0.0548988749619615,"sales":0.03973676212706208,"accounts":0.04968300794503783,"fashion":0.23842057276237247,"rest":0.15608512861112844,"bags":0.11719918300931291,"trunks":0.0548988749619615,"mhm":0.07756688755509365,"re":0.05535801297334986,"clear":0.04770002733716547,"where":0.02240812676660156,"make":0.11204063383300779,"money":0.06369968165160109,"want":0.06425432037585962,"change":0.04598229140234285,"much":0.029866860217928188,"direct":0.11719918300931291,"attention":0.11368777688150154,"nut":0.058599591504656455,"like":0.12835518717920508,"myself":0.040766424385419185,"look":0.08210776365220578,"week":0.0548988749619615,"york":0.03973676212706208,"paris":0.0362858381103539,"shows":0.04968300794503783,"dior":0.06381545852158015,"saint":0.063815458