 a better term looks like a vampire. &gt;&gt; Yes. &gt;&gt; Uh sometimes he's the considered the most measured man. He spends over million dollars a year biohacking so that he he doesn't have to age. So if you say, \"What's the one thing he wants to be known for? What's the one keyword?\" What do you think that word is? &gt;&gt; [sighs] &gt;&gt; Not dying or death. &gt;&gt; Okay, but the word would be something like longevity. &gt;&gt; Longevity. Okay, I see the the twist there. Okay. &gt;&gt; Okay, so longevity. He wants to live for as long as possible. And you can say aging reversal. Like he he his biological age is going backwards. His chronological age don't begin to stop, it goes forward. So when he does all his chemistry and they look at it and his biology, they're like, \"Wow, you're not 48, you're 36.\" And he takes a thousand vitamins. He's doing all kinds of radical treatments, red light therapy. He's doing everything he can to to grow backwards in his age. So he wants to be known for longevity. What's his enemy? What's he fighting against? What does he want to get rid What? &gt;&gt; Death. That makes sense. Do you see how they're connected now? He wants to be known for longevity and he doesn't he wants to get rid of death. Uh Another fancy or $6 word for death is entropy, where systems start to decay. That's called entropy, right? So longevity and death. What is his rallying cry to let everyone know we're on the same mission? Let's go do this thing. Do you know what he says? &gt;&gt; No. &gt;&gt; He says, \"Don't die.\" And it's perfect. So I want to be known for longevity, my enemy's death, my rallying cry is, \"Don't die.\" So he has a conference, the Don't Die Conference. He might have a package of supplements called Don't Die. So now it becomes really clear and he can build brand extensions","t0":2800,"t1":3000,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"36":0.036733654424846926,"48":0.03526751685802855,"matters":0.040590060557454434,"gt":0.6062420581208987,"mhm":