t;&gt; Find a different lane. Simple as that. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; So you say like Chris, can you be number one personal branding? Maybe, I'm not sure, but I can definitely be number one in unbrand. &gt;&gt; Okay. &gt;&gt; See, this is just it's words and words do matter. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; When you think of why, who do you think of? &gt;&gt; Simon Sinek. &gt;&gt; Who else do you think of number two? When you think of vulnerability, who do you think of? &gt;&gt; Brené Brown. &gt;&gt; Who do you think of number two? That's what I'm saying. If I cannot out research and storytell and do TED Talks that is one of the 10 most viewed TED Talks in the world and compete with Brené who's written so many books, who's been on Oprah, who's been on every single thing you could think of, I'm not going to try to win that game. I'll try to win a different game. Maybe I use the word shadow self.","t0":3000,"t1":3200,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"10":0.019542324424528308,"97":0.03981209660811667,"super":0.025432659477812126,"clear":0.029758277078191803,"now":0.03836544379061107,"right":0.02702394472945189,"whenever":0.03424937098780576,"think":0.10121034418078845,"longevity":0.0731162214368679,"he":0.021666673806635197,"owns":0.03655811071843395,"space":0.05086531895562425,"there":0.05205427135801748,"lot":0.015770396465545206,"people":0.0232616649471541,"like":0.10009504809879566,"friend":0.04266624417171225,"dr":0.03424937098780576,"ken":0.07962419321623335,"vu":0.07962419321623335,"trying":0.019542324424528308,"remove":0.03245857332647794,"brian":0.0731162214368679,"mind":0.023641861816484314,"re":0.034535810156140975,"going":0.04053591709417784,"number":0.2879551879597305,"pretty":0.024790291401908037,"sure":0.07629797843343639,"know":0.03383790766779376,"johnson":0.03655811071843395,"don":0.06258205287931244,"problem":0.04527477591867097,"gt":0.8184628008663694,"okay":0.04342850553872105,"mathematical":0.03981209660811667,"parts":0.03655811071843395,"support":0.0268958477