. Maybe you guys should ignore me. Cuz what I'm going to say is going to be like what everyone else is saying. The way they deliver it is the way I'm going to deliver it. You know how they start with this? I'll start with that. You know how they conclude with this? I'll conclude with that. You see their tone? I will adopt that tone. So, you're inadvertently signaling to everybody by adopting the corporate uniform, \"I'm like everyone else. Please don't pay attention to me.\" This hurts, cuz a lot of people dress this way. So, my intention is different because I'm maybe more secure in myself, I'm more self-confident. I could give a flying rat whatever what you think about what corporate looks like. What the What job I'm trying to solve is, I'm going to be different. Whatever you heard before and after may or may not matter, but this will not be the same presentation. I'm not the same person. I actually care a lot about design and intentionality, and I'm going to tell you why it's an advantage to be different by proving it to you, not just talking about it. Imagine if I came on stage and I'm like, \"Dare to be different.\" And I look like every single other person. The best way to un-blind yourself is to look just like everyone else. There would be a mismatch, a misalignment between message and delivery. You see the problem. &gt;&gt; I do. I think you used the tool very well there. Put the hammer to the nail. &gt;&gt; Hammer to the nail? &gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; Right? So, you see if you just let me lead you, you I'll take you to the promised land. Now, here's the thing. Are they going to light me up in the comments? &gt;&gt; Probably.","t0":3800,"t1":4000,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"wearing":0.09089568021107389,"like":0.15286851887953826,"hey":0.11652483492600181,"wouldn":0.041076241841586675,"hire":0.04957182321810855,"re":0.1406513308340897,"saying":0.061735327178471425,"going":0.16508750366936567,"business":0.039908069466010596,"meeting":0.052306789545612804,"lo