re. No, not probably. I would take odds and I would bet that yes, they're going to light me up in the comments. But you know what they don't pay attention to? Is how many people say positive things before, during, and after that make the negative comments seem tiny, relatively speaking. So, I told you before my philosophy, my ideas are meant to compel and to simultaneously repel. I know if I do something doesn't repel people, I'm not doing anything of note. If you play it really safe, if you drive down the middle lane always at 55 mph, you're not going to offend nobody. You're not going to get You're not going to break a speed record here. I'm I'm here to break things. So, somebody during our conversation at dinner I said so what's what's this all about? You're not on stage right now, right? Why Why you look like this? What What job are you trying to solve? They're trying to test me. Do you know what I said? &gt;&gt; Tell me. &gt;&gt; Guess. Can you guess or not? You don't have to. &gt;&gt; Give me Give me a second. What did he say to you? &gt;&gt; Right? So, like now I'm not on stage per se, like I'm just out for dinner. &gt;&gt; Chris, why are you doing this? &gt;&gt; Yeah. And I like being tested, by the way, cuz that caught me off guard, too. I'm like, \"Oh, I wasn't It's just theory, man. You don't turn the lens back on me.\" And I had to think real quick and I said \"So, here's something you don't know about me. I hate social events. It took a lot of energy for me even to decide to come to this. Even to say yes, I'll be there. That was a lot of effort for me. And my biggest problem as a socially awkward introvert is I don't know how to start conversations with people, but I enjoy the company of other people. And so when I walk into a room and if there's 18 people and they all know each other, they're chopping it up like they go way back, I feel like I'm brought back to junior high again. Like I'm the new kid who just transferred into school and I look like nobody and I feel very much the outsider. What I do is I am a provocateur. So I want to wear things that invite people to have a conversation with me. So they can say, \"Hey, what's up with your hat? Why did you wear this today? And let's have a conversation. Or are you in the creative space? Or you must be doing something. Or you're an important person. I need to talk to you, right?\" I'm like, \"Am I?\" That solves most of my problem. So in social circles, the job, unlike on stage, is come talk to me, please. I'd like to have a conversation","t0":4000,"t1":4200,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"18":0.06468348438949147,"55":0.07518926786658117,"gt":0.3381331995433578,"sure":0.04803221153760837,"probably":0.03955031553730855,"take":0.033647337603749675,"odds":0.07518926786658117,"bet":0.07518926786658117,"yes":0.0791006310746171,"re":0.17393187846932417,"going":0.10207503709614671,"light":0.05853799501469807,"me":0.28671932632882385,"comments":0.09139160982420388,"know":0.12781278658706352,"don":0.11819268861675171,"pay":0.04935101180446947,"attention":0.04465010467752975,"many":0.028339444850290062,"people":0.13179619053604297,"say":0.10322986376271322,"positive":0.061301377529412844,"things":0.08106193375028689,"before":0.05737577748281473,"during":0.08377344432562994,"after":0.03752642806051867,"make":0.026401920238065122,"negative":0.061301377529412844,"seem":0.05853799501469807,"tiny":0.06904377849178776,"relatively":0.061301377529412844,"speaking":0.061301377529412844,"told":0.04465010467752975,"philosophy":0.05620158838919165,"ideas":0.03817148888813553,"meant":0.05417770091240176,"compel":0.06904377849178776,"simultaneously":0.07518926786658117,"repel":0.13808755698357553,"something":0.07016402704723118,"doesn":0.040289810575233446,"doing":0.09674180485726566,"anything":0.04465010467752975,"note":0.06904377849178776,"play":0.04569580491210194,"really":0.025518759274036677,"safe":0.06468348438949147,"drive":0.04935101180446947,"down":0.03955031553730855,"middle":0.