458,"even":0.028837075760647243,"high":0.04706387025000841,"higher":0.0711108478942066,"goal":0.04947022546107446,"posts":0.06313665080942674,"maintain":0.06313665080942674,"needed":0.05788418146657449,"earn":0.0711108478942066,"withdrawing":0.0774403242020303,"accounts":0.06029053667764055,"got":0.038649914244508386,"orders":0.0774403242020303,"magnitude":0.06662001298546422}},{"id":"doc_1785765215770_m53hnx_c22","text":"But, I told her let's get the property. I'm going to get back to work. I've been get myself into the next gear and there are many gears to to the way my mind and my body work, and I've been super hyper focused on doing whatever it takes to get us to that goal. And I realized something really important about myself. I already knew this, but it was just confirmation. I can only be pushed so much. I need to be pulled towards something. So, not having something to pull me the old pull was make enough money so your wife and your family have financial security. This is important. As a provider, I need to do that. And when I shot past that goal, I'm good. So, I didn't feel like I needed to do anything anymore, right? And so, that was okay. So, now I've I've like found a new thing to pull me, which is in order to achieve the next level, I've got to make a certain amount of money. It means I have to get super focused, no more messing around. Let's get work done. So, when I'm ready to make that announcement, everybody will know that's what he was talking about. &gt;&gt; I don't see you as a person that like we hear about you messing around. Like what is messing around for Chris? &gt;&gt; Messing around means something like this. I haven't launched a new product or course in years. I haven't changed a lot of the workshops that I'm doing. I've been refining them. And it also means sometimes I'll do a 6-hour Netflix binge. And my my friends my friend Jewel in particular would say, \"I hate you.\" I'm like, \"What now? Why do you hate me, Jewel?\" And she'll say things like, \"How is it that you can get this thing done, make those posts, manage content, watch TV, figure out the brain raw stuff on Instagram? Like what are you doing in your life that I'm not cuz I could barely show up and get XYZ done?\" I live a highly optimized life. But part of that meant there were long kind of lulls. Like oh, let me go for 4-hour walk or let me just leisurely work out in the gym for 2 hours. I'm literally probably doing 15 minutes of work, but I'm just stretching out for 2 hours cuz I get to enjoy my life. Now I'm like, \"You know what? I got to cut some of this stuff out. I got to be more efficient. Let's get stuff done.\" So, I'm not sitting there on the couch like, \"Oh, let me do 3 hours of YouTube to kind of know what's going on.\" I don't have time for that anymore. So, I'm getting stuff done. And if you think I've been cooking before, you ain't seen nothing yet. &gt;&gt; Okay. So, what are some ways that people want to support and looking to","t0":4400,"t1":4600,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"15":0.04940502136025806,"told":0.0434277699963276,"her":0.040740037433825885,"let":0.17162791493365323,"property":0.06715364619352636,"going":0.04964032296668867,"back":0.03136447182459607,"work":0.11254017176760572,"ve":0.2258072793614175,"myself":0.0934345775955127,"next":0.07556361417021468,"gear":0.07313089755745683,"there":0.057371139584773315,"many":0.027563628387222327,"gears":0.07313089755745683,"way":0.0251009645588549,"mind":0.0434277699963276,"body":0.05095821613171089,"super":0.0934345775955127,"hyper":0.06715364619352636,"focused":0.13430729238705272,"doing":0.12545788729838428,"whatever":0.03994299382731296,"takes":0.052694540161686815,"us":0.03011795084704674,"goal":0.0934345775955127,"realized":0.05095821613171089,"something":0.09099096931962197,"really":0.024820161483344334,"important":0.07556361417021468,"already":0.05095821613171089,"knew":0.04940502136025806,"just":0.05462335241932717,"confirmation":0.07313089755745683,"o