962320005814307,"say":0.0502019291177098,"hate":0.09599997156598469,"why":0.027902533329760632,"she":0.03712651183739702,"things":0.026280931401986323,"posts":0.05962320005814307,"manage":0.06291271885957182,"content":0.04158265052248108,"watch":0.05962320005814307,"tv":0.052694540161686815,"figure":0.03918684266237305,"brain":0.05095821613171089,"raw":0.05962320005814307,"stuff":0.19199994313196939,"instagram":0.05962320005814307,"life":0.07977388432685953,"cuz":0.06845332919520035,"barely":0.07313089755745683,"show":0.03476278606989542,"xyz":0.07313089755745683,"live":0.045537321954624926,"highly":0.06715364619352636,"optimized":0.07313089755745683,"part":0.03918684266237305,"meant":0.052694540161686815,"were":0.02896866396448804,"long":0.03712651183739702,"kind":0.06952557213979084,"lulls":0.07313089755745683,"oh":0.07425302367479404,"go":0.028604652488942204,"walk":0.05095821613171089,"leisurely":0.07313089755745683,"gym":0.07313089755745683,"hours":0.1639890659801106,"literally":0.05962320005814307,"probably":0.03846759193155473,"minutes":0.06291271885957182,"stretching":0.07313089755745683,"enjoy":0.0546630219933702,"cut":0.05962320005814307,"some":0.04964032296668867,"efficient":0.07313089755745683,"sitting":0.04940502136025806,"couch":0.07313089755745683,"youtube":0.04671728879775635,"time":0.024274109585793575,"getting":0.05095821613171089,"think":0.023239178361091354,"cooking":0.07313089755745683,"before":0.027902533329760632,"ain":0.06291271885957182,"seen":0.03994299382731296,"nothing":0.05095821613171089,"yet":0.04671728879775635,"ways":0.056935467495641365,"people":0.0213646929099357,"want":0.024544607372010408,"support":0.04940502136025806,"looking":0.03778180708510734}},{"id":"doc_1785765215770_m53hnx_c23","text":"the book, how can we show up for you? &gt;&gt; A lot of different things. So, we have some goals in terms of growing the YouTube channel. You can support us financially by becoming a member. The patron level is one that counts the most, but we appreciate any and everything you do. A lot of people assume, \"Oh, this is free content.\" And that's the relationship we've created for people. It's not free. It's free for you, but it's not free. It costs us money. It costs me money to have you here and the wonderful people and the electricity and just the space to be able to do this. We try our best to give as much value as possible. And if you feel like your life has been transformed, if you've made some kind of money or transformation in your life, give some of it back so that we can do this. Because Annalapae said something to this effect, \"Every dollar you spend is a vote for the world that you want.\" Which means that when you spend money with one organization, in a weird way, you hope the other organization goes away. And if you spend money with guru marketers and scam-a-thons or whatever else you're you're investing in, you're saying, \"Chris, you guys should die. You should burn into oblivion and we'll continue to support the people who are disingenuous and who know how to put their marketing hooks into you and make promises that no one in their right mind can deliver on. We already know this. But yet, they squeeze and you give. &gt;&gt; Mhm. &gt;&gt; I'd like to play the anti-squeeze, which is if you want, just give. If you don't, that's totally cool. &gt;&gt; Where can we get the books, the workbooks? &gt;&gt; Probably just go to future.com. We'll figure out where you can get them. But if you follow me on social at the Chris Do, you'll know because I'll I'm not trying to make it a secret. I'll tell you. &gt;&gt; Anything else for 2026 that is keeping you up at night? &gt;&gt; Nothing keeps me up at night. I sleep really, really well. But I will tell you something. The next chapter of what holds in what's in store for us in 2026, if all comes to fruition, fingers crossed cuz I don't like talking about chickens before they hatch, you're going to say, \"Oh my god, that guy had a dream and he's just making his dreams come true and we get to ride along and be a part of it. Not just from a voyeur point of view, but we get to learn through the whole process. That's what I'm doing. &gt;&gt; Awesome, man. Well, great talking to you as always. &gt;&gt; Thanks for always having me on your show. &gt;&gt; Of course, man. Thanks for having me in the future. I'll see you guys in the next one. &gt;&gt; [music]","t0":4600,"t1":4798,"tsReal":false,"tfIdfVector":{"2026":0.1102846896441086,"book":0.035957251390524754,"show":0.06733593736059955,"gt":0.5005296920732543,"lot":0.05611265271463013,"different":0.029962812923829057,"things":0.02545324110536242,"some":0.07211542979734481,"goals":0.05774543007400693,"terms":0.05774543007400693,"growing":0.05774543007400693,"youtube":0.045245976916490335,"channel":0.0551423448220543,"support":0.09569812433688595,"us":0.08750825297440507,"financially":0.07082771684571354,"becoming":0.05103498103458562,"member":0.06503871272761824,"patron":0.06503871272761824,"level":0.04935334070395901,"counts":0.07082771684571354,"most":0.02545324110536242,"appreciate":0.06093134894014958,"everything":0.0342068039826279,"people":0.08276733749817099,"assume":0.06503871272761824,"oh":0.07191450278104951,"free":0.1913962486737719,"content":0.040273048673942366,"relationship":0.037256095577440376,"ve":0.06248449044691541,"created":0.040273048673942366,"costs":0.14165543369142708,"money":0.1767480450546319,"me":0.11253642438842038,"here":0.02916941765813502,"wonderful":0.0551423448220543,"electricity":0.07082771684571354,"just":0.08817174563095542,"space":0.045245976916490335,"able":0.037952694262879026,"try":0.040273048673942366,"best":0.03534960901092638,"give":0.1346718747211991,"much":0.0331487317899717,"value":0.05103498103458562,"possible":0.04784906216844297,"feel":0.029560604892831095,"like":0.05342223340446387,"life":0.05150765982186313,"transformed":0.05774543007400693,"made":0.03476677539673639,"kind":0.033667968680299774,"transformation":0.0650387