≈8:21] it's it's the best respect that we can pay to like great artists that have inspired us so much is to never [&nbsp;__&nbsp;] never sell out we gotta fight you know you\n  QUOTE: \"and do it again the next day the way everything happened though was like Focus energy yo and actually I never seen that from a laughable you know people can write right\" (≈6:45)\n\nTAKEAWAYS & HEURISTICS:\n  - and do it again the next day the way everything happened though was like Focus energy yo and actually I never seen that from a laughable you know people can write right\n  - it's it's the best respect that we can pay to like great artists that have inspired us so much is to never [&nbsp;__&nbsp;] never sell out we gotta fight you know you\n  - but one thing I could do is go to the studio and turn it up loud and that's the reason why a lot of the music on there are you know they\n  - feel like maybe a lot of the rules of hip-hop like a lot of your aggression and the negativity that people have towards people maybe I'm not hip-hop because of that\n  - and I'm not trying to do it the best way that I know how what what little information I get all these people that you know fought so hard you know\n\nNOTABLE QUOTES:\n  - [≈3:51] \"and compare that to Jesus walks All Falls Down stand up Overnight Celebrity hold on I'm not feeling I'm gonna name everything nominated slow jams but if I could play you that\"\n  - [≈6:45] \"and do it again the next day the way everything happened though was like Focus energy yo and actually I never seen that from a laughable you know people can write right\"\n\nQUESTIONS THIS ANSWERS:\n  - What does the source teach about like?\n  - What does the source teach about know?\n  - What does the source teach about people?\n  - What does the source teach about me?\n  - How does kanye 7 principles apply today?","uploadedAt":"2026-08-22T14:54:37.989Z","kind":"digest","title":"um so for establishing purposes would you please introduce yourself what's up I'm Kany