gination it's better than any movie but that's somewhat of a new distraction we're facing one of the oldest distractions that we still face today is impressing others\n  QUOTE: \"and even physical problems fear comes in many forms from letting your parents down to not making enough money to falling behind your friends fear makes us feel like we're constantly competing\" (≈3:27)\n[5:20–10:40] Trends · Think · True\n  - [≈5:43] and to be in the club in the freezing Cod at 3:00 a.m. the places they go to pick up a girl if you can focus that energy into something valuable put\n  - [≈7:28] because when you're held back back from your ideas and being the real you you will never reach your full potential you'll lose focus and start creating something that sounds manufactured\n  - [≈8:15] and they aren't saying how they feel anymore they're not expressing themselves they're just chasing trends for approval but as Kanye says trend is always late Kanye hardly ever chased Trends he\n  - [≈10:13] front of everyone as long as his ideas help the next person let's be less concerned with ownership ideas it is important that our ideas\n  QUOTE: \"because when you're held back back from your ideas and being the real you you will never reach your full potential you'll lose focus and start creating something that sounds manufactured\" (≈7:28)\n[10:40–12:09] Take · Different · Update\n  - [≈10:52] and update them at your will all great artists take and update this is one of the most important concepts of his creative process While most artists are too concerned with being\n  - [≈11:05] original Kanye doesn't care Kanye will take ideas from others and create something new new and different Pablo Picasso said it best good artist copy great artist steal as an artist it's\n  - [≈11:52] magical about it it's about confidence love authenticity discipline and courage Kanye is no different than any of us he just listens to his gut\n  - [≈12:02] and goes for it I hope this video inspires you to pursue what you love thank you for watching\n  QUOTE: \"and update them at your will all great artists take and update this is one of the most important concepts of his creative process While most artists are too concerned with being\" (≈10:52)\n\nTAKEAWAYS & HEURISTICS:\n  - because when you're held back back from your ideas and being the real you you will never reach your full potential you'll lose focus and start creating something that sounds manufactured\n  - and they aren't saying how they feel anymore they're not expressing themselves they're just chasing trends for approval but as Kanye says trend is always late Kanye hardly ever chased Trends he\n  - with each other I don't believe in the concept of an enemy we have been conditioned to always being competition stop looking for something to beat\n  - front of everyone as long as his ideas help the next person let's be less concerned with ownership ideas it is important that our ideas\n  - and some people are going to think you're crazy for doing so they don't want you to step out of line they want you to stay right there and follow the rules\n\nNOTABLE QUOTES:\n  - [≈3:27] \"and even physical problems fear comes in many forms from letting your parents down to not making enough money to falling behind your friends fear makes us feel like we're constantly competing\"\n  - [≈7:28] \"because when you're held back back from your ideas and being the real you you will never reach your full potential you'll lose focus and start creating something that sounds manufactured\"\n  - [≈10:52] \"and update them at your will all great artists take and update this is one of the most important concepts of his creative process While most artists are too concerned with being\"\n\nQUESTIONS THIS ANSWERS:\n  - What does the source teach about kanye?\n  - What does the source teach about people?\n  - What does the source teach about re?\n  - What does the source teach about he?\n  - How does kanye genius creative apply today?","up